<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</font></span><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">I'm reaching out to all of my clients this week as we head into the last 60 days of 2017 to see who is still looking to add another property or properties to their portfolio before the end of the year.</font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">If you are looking to acquire a property in either Memphis, Dallas, or Houston, please reply to this email and let me know asap so that I can find a property for you that matches your investment criteria.</font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Remember, Memphis properties are typically $110K-150k with a rare few coming in between $90-100k (no conventional financing on those), and Dallas and Houston are usually $160-200k although we do get a few in Texas between $140-160k on occasion.</font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">If you want me to be on the lookout for a property for you before the end of the year, please reply to this email with the following info:</font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">1. Do you have a market preference (Memphis, Dallas, or Houston)?</font></b></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></b></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">2. What purchase method will you be using (Cash, Conventional financing, or non-recourse financing for your IRA/ solo-401k)?</font></b></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></b></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">3. Do you have a preferred price point?</font></b></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></b></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">4. What is your total budget to allocate towards your next property.</font></b></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></b></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">5. Is there any other investment criteria that I need to know?</font></b></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Once I receive this information from you, I will reach out to schedule a call with you in the next few days to make sure we are on the same page with what properties I will be looking for that would be a good fit for you.</font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Looking forward to hearing back from you, and to helping you finish off 2017 strong!</font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif">Ashley</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">---------</div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><table border="0" style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small; color: rgb(0, 0, 153);"><tbody><tr><td width="200px" style="margin: 0px;"><font face="georgia, serif" size="2"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Ashley Tinker</span><br></font><blockquote style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"></blockquote><font size="2"><font face="georgia, serif"><font color="#000000">Portfolio Advisor</font><font color="#741b47">&nbsp;</font><br><b><font color="#666666">Tel:&nbsp;<a value="+19017517191" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34);">901.505.0724</a></font></b><br><b><font color="#666666">Fax:&nbsp;<a value="+19017517187" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34);">901.751.7187</a></font></b></font><br></font><blockquote style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"></blockquote><font size="2"><b><font color="#990000"><a href="http://www.memphisinvest.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">www.MemphisInvest.com</a></font></b><br><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><a href="mailto:ashleybush@memphisinvest.com" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">ashley.tinker@memphisinvest.com</a></b>&nbsp;</font><br><br><img src="https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/P-ZUATG-9KvjtTCYPKyMYZvbZ1icP24mB3AQG8FiodVo-sdJ2JgTowsNbAbkh7l2lFLFbGwo2IeCTAWCabhVQv1K4a8rul-WiunKnoxlWZI0uzWqL8S3lDRln2IqOfbrtqKAikZg-5guzwjsB7ufNvHZ26--Z-xThtVQ2w=s0-d-e1-ft#http://info.memphisinvest.com/hs-fs/hub/44341/file-2286025665-png/Memphis-Invest-Logo-email-footer.png"><br><br><div style="text-align: center;"><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); text-align: start;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 153);"></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table><font size="2" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><span style="text-align: center; outline: none; font-family: &quot;Lato Regular&quot;, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><font color="#0b5394"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/CMYYR" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">Click Here</a>&nbsp;</font></span><font face="arial narrow, sans-serif" style="text-align: center;"><b><font color="#666666">to schedule a&nbsp;15-minute&nbsp;Phone Call</font></b></font></font></div>]]></td>
